              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katataka, Nzambi wanyi, ndi nkusengelela ne, Utabale mesu ebe, teleja matshu ebe ku kulomba kundi ndomba mu muaba eu.",
          "type": "text",
